# Title: Potential Arbitrary File Download Using Office Application
# ID: 4ae3e30b-b03f-43aa-87e3-b622f4048eed
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), Beyu Denis, oscd.community
# Date: 2022-05-17
# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1202
# Description: Detects potential arbitrary file download using a Microsoft Office application
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_exec="*http://*" OR process_exec="*https://*")) AND (((process_path="*\\EXCEL.EXE" OR process_path="*\\MSOXMLED.EXE" OR process_path="*\\POWERPNT.EXE" OR process_path="*\\WINWORD.exe")) OR ((process_name="Excel.exe" OR process_name="msoxmled.exe" OR process_name="POWERPNT.EXE" OR process_name="WinWord.exe"))))
